WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 2 - Scene 24h: Confrontation with Seifer
Duration: ~40 seconds
Inside the Lunatic Pandora - The Final Confrontation
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The interior of Lunatic Pandora opens before the party. The chamber is vast and geometric, 
with crystalline structures towering overhead. Translucent walls shimmer with an ethereal 
blue-white light. The floor is smooth and reflective, creating an oppressive sense of scale.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Seifer Almasy stands in the center of the chamber, defiant and battle-ready. He grips his 
Hyperion gunblade firmly. His blonde hair falls across his face with an arrogant expression. 
His ornate black leather jacket and military insignia glow faintly with the Pandora's power 
channeling through him.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Behind Seifer, the walls of Lunatic Pandora pulse with energy. He is augmented by the 
machine's ancient power, standing taller, more imposing than before. The team encounters 
him for what seems like the final confrontation within the Pandora.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The battle with Seifer ensues. Spell effects flash across the crystalline chamber — 
magical projectiles arc through the air. Seifer's blade clashes against the party members' 
weapons. The chamber itself seems to react to their combat, pulsing brighter and dimmer 
with each impact.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Seifer staggers backward, defeated. He drops to one knee, his Hyperion gunblade clattering 
against the reflective floor. Defeat washes across his face as his connection to the Pandora's 
power begins to fade.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The party presses deeper into the Pandora. Ahead, a massive structure dominates the 
crystalline chamber — Adel's containment tomb. It is a colossal capsule, a technological 
prison of impossible scale. Inside the translucent walls, the enormous form of Sorceress 
Adel can be seen suspended in a state of frozen suspension, her massive red-orange frame 
barely fitting within the containment vessel. She has been sealed here for centuries, 
hidden in the depths of space, and the Lunatic Pandora has brought her back down to this 
world. The tomb pulses with a sickly purple light that illuminates the entire chamber.
